<title>HONG KONG: First Shanghai H1 net loss HK$3.44 mln.</title>
<headline>First Shanghai H1 net loss HK$3.44 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.9 loss  vs 1.7 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	 vs 5.39 gain</p>
